        },
        {
          "text": " Bino Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye bye yakoba ku nsi Edomu, ati: “Abantu ab'omu Temani eky'omu nsi Edomu tibakaalimu magezi? Abawi b'amagezi tibakaabakobera kya kukola? Obwo amagezi gabaweereiremu irala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abantu ab'e Dedani, mukyuke mulumuke, muje mwegise! Nja kuzikiriza baidhukulu ba Esau, kuba ekiseera kituuse eky'okubabonereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bwe baba banoga emizabbibu balekakuuku egindi, n'abaibi bwe baidha okwiba obwire batwalaku ebyo bye benda byonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nze baidhukulu ba Esau mbatoireku buli kantu baasigala bwereere. Era mbwikwire ebifo bye beegisaamu, baaba nga tibakaasobola kwegisa. Abantu boonaboona ab'omu Edomu bazikiriziibwa, tighakaaligho muntu waire mulala ati asigairegho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke bamulekwa baimwe, nze ndidha kubalabirira. Ni banamwandu baimwe beesige nze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
