          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24+GEN.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 19:24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga Sodoma ni Gomorra bwe baabizikiriza aghalala n'ebibuga ebyali agho okumpi nabyo, n'ensi Edomu etyo bwe baligizikiriza, yaaloba kwiramu kubangamu bantu. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mag 12:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ng'empologoma bw'evaayo mu kibira ekizibirivu ekiri ku mbali kw'omwiga Yorudani n'eja n'erumba ebyayiro by'ensolo ebirungi, zeena ntyo bwendiidha okuzindula Abaedomu, balumuke bave mu nsi yaibwe. Olwo omuntu ye ndirondagho n'alifuga eighanga eryo. Naani asobola okwegeza ku nze? Naani asobola okuneesonsaaku? Era mufuzi ki asobola okuntakania? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni muwulire kye ntegeike okukola abantu b'omu Edomu, akabi ke neesoomeire okutuusa ku bantu b'omu kibuga Temani. Ni bwe baba abaana baibwe, abazigu balibakwekwebya baabatwala, era abantu boonaboona balitya inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi Edomu bw'erigwa, omuvuuma guliba gwa maani inho n'ensi yoonayoona yaatengeeta. Era okulira kwaibwe kulija ghala inho kwatuuka ni ku Nhandha Emyufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazigu balirumba Bozira baakigwaku ng'oti n'enkookooma eyandhulwiza amaghagha gaayo. Ku lunaku olwo, abalwani ba Edomu ab'amaani baliidhula okutya ng'oti n'omukazi ali kulumwa okuzaala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
